                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238498980",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198008964408",
                            "num_reviews": 23,
                            "playtime_forever": 10656,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1917,
                            "playtime_at_review": 8859,
                            "last_played": 1793919154
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is such a great game, I had originally played this game in my teens. I am now 32 married and going to have a kid soon. I came back and its been updated and people are still playing.... A joy in a world that can feel almost joyless.\n\nBack in the day I played with a dear friend of mine, Poohb, however he died after playing for a few years of cancer.... I stopped playing and never felt like returning.... Until now. I miss my friend but the game we loved is still living and people are still having fun, and the group we built is still semi together after all these years, that is something I am proud of.\n\nHere is to another great years of Puzzle Pirates, if you are new or old to this game and want a group to play with, please reach out! We play other games too and would love to have you. Regardless if you play with us, I hope you have fun in this amazing game. \n\nHere's to Poohb!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792885705,
